---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Yingqian Chen.">
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-prose px-6 pt-20 pb-24">
    <h1 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>

    <div class="prose-body">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Yingqian Chen. This site collects projects I've built or helped build
        &mdash; mostly small, curious things at the intersection of LLMs,
        data, and well-crafted software.
      </p>

      <p>
        I care about lean interfaces, sharp writing, and code that makes its
        intent obvious. When I'm not coding I take photos and read about cities.
      </p>

      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/YingqianChen">GitHub &mdash; @YingqianChen</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>This site</h2>
      <p>
        Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a> and Tailwind. The source
        lives at <a href="https://github.com/YingqianChen/YingqianChen.github.io">
        YingqianChen/YingqianChen.github.io</a>. Posts are drafted with a custom
        Claude Code slash command &mdash; see the README for details.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
